one's support! Thank you.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-28T19:39:31Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842212951304209","verified_at":"2026-10-20T22:24:00Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5091680-1842212951300849","game_id":"steam-5091680","kind":"announcement","title":"Launch Bug Correction","summary":"Hello, Thank you for downloading and trying out my game! This is my first game and I am still working on dialing it in 100%. Users have experienced crashing on startup. After vigorous testing across multiple systems, I have narrowed the bug down to a DX11/DX12 conflict. I have added a DX11 launch option from Steam, this should bypass the DX12 conflict bug that I believe is happening. Please let me know if you are experiencing any issues launching the game or otherwise! Thank you very much.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-27T17:20:59Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842212951300849","verified_at":"2026-10-20T22:24:00Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-5091680":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T08:02:45Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T08:02:45Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-5091680":"2026-10-26T08:02:45Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"5091680":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T08:02:45Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T08:02:45Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T08:02:45Z"},"5127080":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T08:02:45Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T08:02:45Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T08:02:45Z"}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-5091680","app_id":5091680,"app_scope":"base","observed_a